{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/extras/9ec8654c8afd2ee39377270f7266eb1f.avif?t=1754576451\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the legendary Florida Man in this short roguelite experience set in the Sunshine State. <i>Florida Survivor</i> is a top-down 2D shooter where aiming is up to you, but as a trigger-happy man, you\u2019ll shoot whenever you can! Buy upgrades from the bar to grow stronger, or add quirky traits to your Florida Man to make things even more chaotic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/extras/df2d98f7411b9b7f0bafb1b00aafbf01.avif?t=1754576451\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As <strong>Florida Man</strong> and his trusty shotgun battle through three different stages against vampires, he faces a variety of enemies that keep him alert. Different invocations empower the vampires, making each fight unique. Killing enemies allows the Florida Man to gain experience. As he levels up, he can choose ingredients that provide an instant and permanent power increase. Each choice is crucial, as the selected ingredients are later used to <strong>blend</strong> powerful cocktails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/extras/33f5c0f50509db664bac99b62b42b10e.avif?t=1754576451\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blend</strong> ingredients into cocktails with potent effects that can alter your playstyle. Strategically pick ingredients to create your preferred cocktails and <strong>survive</strong> the relentless horde of vampires</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/extras/f7d988522e7466c460931118ead27cdb.avif?t=1754576451\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive</strong> to keep the vampires on their heels, making them retreat all the way back to the swamps. Confront their leader, Count Venture, to end the ritual and bring back the sun to the <strong>Sunshine State</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891840?t=1754576451","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/6b3e65620bd89d27018931039ebb8029ebefb8bc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754576451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/5687349ab9b100453093b9a160cb6494d946dda5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754576451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/5687349ab9b100453093b9a160cb6494d946dda5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754576451","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891840/extras/9ec8654c8afd2ee39377270f7266eb1f.avif?t=1754576451\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the legendary Florida Man in this short roguelite experience set in the Sunshine State. <i>Florida Survivor</i> is a top-down 2D shooter where aiming is up to you, but as a trigger-happy man, you\u2019ll shoot whenever you can! Buy upgrades from the bar to grow stronger, or add quirky traits to your Florida Man to make things even more chao